WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.267
[music playing]

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.836
OK, you're good, Cara.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.638
You know the bit I said about
gravity doing the first bit?

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.639
Yeah.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:08.942
That's wrong.

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.511
You're just going to have to
muscle it out most of the way.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:17.250
Oh, no.

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.451
Hopefully, I'll get across
before I get scared.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.953
That's what I'm hoping for.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:23.690
So speed is my key, which
probably isn't very clever.

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.692
But whatever.

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:28.995
[grunting]

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:32.132
I'll tell you what, this is
going to be a workout for her.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.700
Oh, my god.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:34.501
Oh, god, I'm scared.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.741
[grunting] Oh, no.

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:51.317
[grunting] Oh, [bleep].

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.253
This is going to be so long.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.654
There's so much
friction with the rope

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.490
and the carabiner over
it that each couple

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.993
of feet is like a pull-up.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:02.896
[bleep]

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:04.497
Oh.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.565
Oh.

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:07.367
So she's about a
quarter of the way

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:11.471
and already she's
grinding to a halt.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:12.305
[grunting]

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:15.008
Come on, Cara, you can do this.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:16.776
[grunting]

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:19.679
Push that device as
far forward as you can.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.313
There you go.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.648
You need both hands.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:22.615
[grunting]

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.017
Great job.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.018
Keep pushing.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:25.852
[grunting]

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:28.588
You can do it.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:31.858
Guys, phhh!

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:39.532
[grunting] Oh, god.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.533
Come on.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.768
Go, girl.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.936
You're doing so well.

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:45.505
Just inch it out, muscle it out.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.274
[grunting]

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:51.845
So close.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:52.679
So close.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:55.081
Keep coming.

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:56.015
OK.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:59.219
Come on, you bastard.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.520
[grunting]

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:03.656
Another 5 foot
and you're there.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:04.791
I'm so close.

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:05.692
I'm so close.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.532
[grunting]

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:13.867
[inaudible].
Come on here.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:14.834
[grunting]

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:15.802
Here we go.

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:19.839
[grunting] Ugh!

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:20.707
Here we go.

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:21.674
Here we go.

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.042
Ooh!

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.578
Oh.

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:26.679
Oh, my god.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.115
That was really hard.

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.250
Sweat.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.085
Speed is usually my go-to.

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:33.653
It was a bad idea, because
after I got halfway,

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.357
it just tore me up--
my core, my arms.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.326
Yeah, that last bit
was really hardcore.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.594
My stomach is shaking.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.129
[laughs] It's good.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.531
It's good.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:45.532
Never give up.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.165
Never give up.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.634
Never give up.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.902
[inaudible]

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:52.505
So that was definitely
harder work than I anticipated.

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.607
But our Cara muscled it out.

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:57.277
She's got great natural
physicality of strength,

00:02:57.343 --> 00:03:00.079
and most importantly, kind
of that never give up spirit.

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:01.147
And out here, that is king.

